450
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:27,000
Lê belê hawirdora vî gundî, ya dar û ber, gund ji bayê
dijwar diparêze.
 
However, the environment of this village, of trees and wood,
protects the village from severe winds.

451
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:47,000
